{"3045520": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sea Sniffers", "steam_appid": 3045520, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045520/extras/597c57e7c733530878092da46aec1d96.poster.avif?t=1778842522\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045520/extras/597c57e7c733530878092da46aec1d96.webm?t=1778842522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045520/extras/597c57e7c733530878092da46aec1d96.mp4?t=1778842522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sea Sniffers is a unique take on collecting fish</strong> where you play as a seal that throws a mean punch!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore sunken ships, uncover hidden caves, and meet the ocean’s eccentric inhabitants, whose mischievous stories range from silly escapades to chaotic adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quirky quests weave together a blend of RPG-progression and offbeat storytelling!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045520/extras/2ccb7ecb7f04c99675c67457ac1e4ff7.poster.avif?t=1778842522\" width=1170 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045520/extras/2ccb7ecb7f04c99675c67457ac1e4ff7.webm?t=1778842522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045520/extras/2ccb7ecb7f04c99675c67457ac1e4ff7.mp4?t=1778842522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch and document every single creature found within the ocean depths. But be prepared for a struggle, they won't be caught without a fight!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045520/extras/e0ff3a2ffdbaeb5935d0638f1727bd0e.avif?t=1778842522\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045520/extras_big/e0ff3a2ffdbaeb5935d0638f1727bd0e.webp?t=1778842522 width=1560 height=197 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy fishing RPG focused on exploration, discovery and storytelling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Laid-back gameplay with action elements. Sit back, relax, and explore at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft your own playstyle by experimenting with different gear options and unlockable abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture, and document over 100 unique species of fish, invertebrates, and rare mythological sea creatures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handcrafted vibrant pixel art, showcasing the world’s vast oceans and sea life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack composed by Jamphibious, featuring that unique frogalicious sound 🐸</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045520/extras/ff333e0b6d3325d97c6bb8d991f813da.avif?t=1778842522\" width=780 height=1909 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045520/extras/597c57e7c733530878092da46aec1d96.poster.avif?t=1778842522\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045520/extras/597c57e7c733530878092da46aec1d96.webm?t=1778842522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045520/extras/597c57e7c733530878092da46aec1d96.mp4?t=1778842522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sea Sniffers is a unique take on collecting fish</strong> where you play as a seal that throws a mean punch!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore sunken ships, uncover hidden caves, and meet the ocean’s eccentric inhabitants, whose mischievous stories range from silly escapades to chaotic adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quirky quests weave together a blend of RPG-progression and offbeat storytelling!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045520/extras/2ccb7ecb7f04c99675c67457ac1e4ff7.poster.avif?t=1778842522\" width=1170 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045520/extras/2ccb7ecb7f04c99675c67457ac1e4ff7.webm?t=1778842522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045520/extras/2ccb7ecb7f04c99675c67457ac1e4ff7.mp4?t=1778842522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch and document every single creature found within the ocean depths. But be prepared for a struggle, they won't be caught without a fight!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045520/extras/e0ff3a2ffdbaeb5935d0638f1727bd0e.avif?t=1778842522\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045520/extras_big/e0ff3a2ffdbaeb5935d0638f1727bd0e.webp?t=1778842522 width=1560 height=197 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy fishing RPG focused on exploration, discovery and storytelling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Laid-back gameplay with action elements. Sit back, relax, and explore at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft your own playstyle by experimenting with different gear options and unlockable abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture, and document over 100 unique species of fish, invertebrates, and rare mythological sea creatures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handcrafted vibrant pixel art, showcasing the world’s vast oceans and sea life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack composed by Jamphibious, featuring that unique frogalicious sound 🐸</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045520/extras/ff333e0b6d3325d97c6bb8d991f813da.avif?t=1778842522\" width=780 height=1909 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Dive! Punch! Catch! Sea Sniffers is a unique take on collecting fish where you play as a seal that throws a mean punch! Upgrade your gear, ship and companions to become the best Sea Sniffer!", "supported_languages": "English, German, Japanese, Portuguese - Portugal, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Traditional Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045520/5d5eef88c8923eba813abfb92d6a83ae9d94fb62/header.jpg?t=1778842522", "capsule_image": "https://shared.